  "details": ".NET is a fast, lightweight and modular platform for creating cross platform applications that work on Linux, macOS and Windows. It particularly focuses on creating console applications, web applications and micro-services. .NET contains a runtime conforming to .NET Standards a set of framework libraries, an SDK containing compilers and a 'dotnet' application to drive everything.  \n\nSDK version: 8.0.131  \nRuntime version: 8.0.31  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * dotnet10.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet8.0: .NET Information Disclosure Vulnerability (CVE-2026-58649)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Update .NET 8.0 to SDK 8.0.131 and Runtime 8.0.31 [almalinux-9.8.z] (JIRA:AlmaLinux-252247)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
